.git
.github
docs
**/*.md
**/.DS_Store

# Python 服务：本地 venv、字节码缓存、测试与基线生成工具都不进镜像
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
services/*/tests
services/logcluster/tools

# 本地跑出来的模板树状态同样不进镜像
services/*/.state

services/ocr/target

# Only the release binary is needed from the build directory. The parent
# directory must be excluded with a wildcard for the re-includes to work.
target/*
!target/release
target/release/*
!target/release/ocr-service
